<<<
prot(h)onotary. The spelling without h, & the pronunciation with -nō- as the accented syllable, are recommended; but prot(h)d’notari is also permissible. ‘ Both pronunciations, with the variants proto- & protho-, are now in official use in different quarters "OED.
===
**prot(h)onotary.** The spelling without h, & the pronunciation with -nō- as the accented syllable, are recommended; but prot(h)ŏ'notarĭ is also permissible. 'Both pronunciations, with the variants *proto-* & *protho-*, are now in official use in different quarters'—OED.
>>>

